= Give the Inspector a Prosecutor's Teeth

SLD proposed additional powers for the State Labour Inspectorate, including a
public-prosecutor role. Inspectors say recommendations without enforceable
consequences have taught repeat offenders exactly how little compliance costs.

- @sld_inspector_full
- @sld_inspector_orders
- @sld_inspector_refuse

@sld_inspector_full
title: Authorise binding findings and public prosecution
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. Enforcement and worker trust jump; business and liberal allies resist.
