= No Conscience Clause in Public Care

Wiosna promised to abolish the conscience clause. Its ministers argue that a
public entitlement cannot disappear when the scheduled professional objects;
medical groups warn against turning employment rules into belief tests.

- @wiosna_conscience_end
- @wiosna_conscience_institution
- @wiosna_conscience_refuse

@wiosna_conscience_end
title: Remove the individual refusal from public provision
subtitle: Rights become uniform; feminist trust surges and professional and conservative resistance hardens.
on-arrival: spring_strength += 5; spring_dissent -= 9; feminist_trust += 9; women_support += 5; health_capacity += 3; progressive_credibility += 5; government_goal_equality = 1; public_trust += 2; psl_relation -= 9; p2050_relation -= 5; government_coalition_dissent += 7; early_election_risk += 3; news_headline = "Government ends the conscience clause in publicly guaranteed care"

Professionals may hold beliefs and may not transfer the public institution's
duty to the patient. Staffing and referral become management obligations.

- #poland_card_finish

@wiosna_conscience_institution
title: Make every institution guarantee immediate provision
subtitle: Preserve individual refusal only when another professional delivers without delay.
on-arrival: spring_strength += 3; spring_dissent -= 5; feminist_trust += 6; women_support += 3; health_capacity += 4; government_goal_equality = 1; public_trust += 4; psl_relation -= 4; p2050_relation -= 2; government_coalition_dissent += 3; news_headline = "Every public institution must deliver care despite individual refusal"

The clause survives only behind a seamless service. A patient may never be the
person tasked with finding the replacement.

- #poland_card_finish

@wiosna_conscience_refuse
title: Keep the clause and strengthen referral guidance
subtitle: Free. Avoid the statutory fight; Wiosna says guidance cannot cure a regional veto.
on-arrival: poland_wiosna_conscience_timer = 8; spring_dissent += 11; spring_strength -= 2; feminist_trust -= 6; women_support -= 3; health_capacity += 1; psl_relation += 5; p2050_relation += 3; government_coalition_dissent -= 4; news_headline = "Cabinet retains the conscience clause with stronger referral guidance"

The patient receives clearer instructions after refusal. In districts where
everyone refuses, the instructions still point elsewhere.

- #poland_card_finish


@pps_six_hour_day
