card-image: img/poland/cards/labour-inspection.webp

= Councils Above Fifty

PPS wants mandatory workers' councils in every company above fifty employees,
including foreign-owned firms. The councils would make democracy at work an
institution rather than a benefit granted by unusually friendly management.

- @pps_councils_mandatory
- @pps_councils_board
- @pps_councils_refuse

@pps_councils_mandatory
title: Require councils with information and veto rights
subtitle: Workplace power and union trust surge; employers and liberal partners call it co-management by statute.
on-arrival: pps_strength += 5; pps_dissent -= 10; labor_strength += 3; workers_support += 7; union_trust += 7; labor_credibility += 6; government_goal_labor = 1; movement_autonomy += 4; economic_growth -= 0.2; capitalism_acceptance -= 5; market_liberal_dissent += 8; ko_relation -= 6; p2050_relation -= 5; government_coalition_dissent += 6; news_headline = "Every large workplace must elect a workers' council"

Accounts, restructuring and mass dismissal enter the council room before the
decision is finished. Selected changes require agreement, not consultation.

- #poland_card_finish

@pps_councils_board
title: Guarantee elected worker seats on supervisory boards
subtitle: Secure co-determination through existing company institutions with a smaller confrontation.
on-arrival: pps_strength += 3; pps_dissent -= 6; labor_strength += 2; workers_support += 5; union_trust += 5; labor_credibility += 4; government_goal_labor = 1; capitalism_acceptance -= 2; market_liberal_dissent += 4; ko_relation -= 2; government_coalition_dissent += 3; news_headline = "Workers gain elected seats on every large company's supervisory board"

The board can no longer discuss labour as an external cost. Workers enter the
same papers and vote, though without the independent institution PPS requested.

- #poland_card_finish

@pps_councils_refuse
title: Encourage voluntary employee forums
subtitle: Free. Avoid a universal mandate; PPS and unions know which firms will volunteer.
on-arrival: poland_pps_councils_timer = 7; pps_dissent += 10; pps_strength -= 2; labor_dissent += 5; union_trust -= 4; workers_support -= 2; market_liberal_dissent -= 3; ko_relation += 3; news_headline = "Cabinet leaves workplace councils to voluntary agreements"

Exemplary employers receive a model charter. Workers who most need one remain
dependent on the employer's example.

- #poland_card_finish


@pps_maximum_wage
title: The Maximum Wage
subtitle: Cap top pay in each enterprise at a multiple of its lowest wage.
new-page: true
