card-image: img/poland/cards/cost-programme.webp

= The Maximum Wage

PPS proposes ending the pay chimney by limiting the highest wage in a workplace
to a few multiples of the lowest. Executives may still earn more—after deciding
whether the quickest route upward is raising everybody beneath them.

- @pps_maximum_ratio
- @pps_maximum_public
- @pps_maximum_refuse

@pps_maximum_ratio
title: Impose a maximum pay ratio in every enterprise
subtitle: Wage compression and PPS strength surge; avoidance, executive flight and coalition dissent follow.
on-arrival: pps_strength += 6; pps_dissent -= 11; workers_support += 8; union_trust += 6; labor_credibility += 5; government_goal_labor = 1; universal_solidarity += 5; left_economic_position -= 4; capitalism_acceptance -= 6; liberal_professionals_left_affinity -= 4; economic_growth -= 0.3; market_liberal_dissent += 10; ko_relation -= 8; p2050_relation -= 7; government_coalition_dissent += 8; news_headline = "Government caps top pay at a multiple of the lowest wage"

Boards can increase the top number by lifting the bottom one. Consultants begin
renaming compensation before the ink dries.

- #poland_card_finish

@pps_maximum_public
title: Apply the ratio to public companies and contractors
subtitle: Begin where public money gives the rule an unambiguous claim.
on-arrival: pps_strength += 3; pps_dissent -= 6; workers_support += 5; public_sector_support += 5; union_trust += 4; government_goal_labor = 1; institutional_trust += 3; public_trust += 4; sld_patronage_exposure -= 3; barons_dissent += 3; market_liberal_dissent += 4; news_headline = "A maximum pay ratio binds public companies and contractors"

No organisation financed by public ownership or procurement may build a pay
chimney the state would condemn elsewhere.

- #poland_card_finish

@pps_maximum_refuse
title: Publish pay ratios and tax extreme remuneration
subtitle: Free. Pressure the top without an enterprise cap; PPS calls disclosure a spectator sport.
on-arrival: poland_pps_maximum_wage_timer = 8; pps_dissent += 10; pps_strength -= 2; public_trust += 2; budget += 1; market_liberal_dissent -= 2; ko_relation += 2; capitalism_acceptance += 1; news_headline = "Cabinet discloses and taxes extreme pay instead of capping it"

The ratios become public and expensive. They remain legal.

- #poland_card_finish


@pps_housing_first
