The largest concentrations receive teams now. Smaller authorities gain money
to buy scattered homes rather than build shelters first.

- #poland_card_finish

@pps_housing_refuse
title: Expand shelters and transitional housing
subtitle: Free. Reach more people quickly; PPS says a staircase of conditions still stands before the front door.
on-arrival: poland_pps_housing_first_timer = 8; pps_dissent += 10; pps_strength -= 2; household_security += 3; public_trust += 1; fiscal_stress -= 1; government_coalition_dissent -= 1; news_headline = "Cabinet expands transitional housing without a housing-first guarantee"

Beds and supported places increase. A permanent home remains the last stage of
the service rather than its first tool.

- #poland_card_finish


