The provider builds the final unprofitable kilometres and leases open access.
Coverage becomes a duty with an accountable owner.

- #poland_card_finish

@pps_fibre_coops
title: Fund consumer cooperatives to build the last mile
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. Common ownership reaches remote areas without one national operator.
choose-if: budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The cooperative capital fund needs two budget points.
