Residents own the last mile and purchase backbone access together. The state
finances a network that cannot later abandon its members for margin.

- #poland_card_finish

@pps_fibre_refuse
title: Tighten commercial coverage obligations
subtitle: Free. Use the existing market and regulator; PPS says access remains a condition in somebody's licence.
on-arrival: poland_pps_public_fibre_timer = 7; pps_dissent += 8; pps_strength -= 1; rural_support += 2; administrative_capacity += 2; market_liberal_dissent -= 2; ko_relation += 2; economic_growth += 0.1; news_headline = "Cabinet tightens broadband obligations without creating public fibre"

The regulator raises the floor and fines delay. Ownership—and the argument
