= Second Breakfast Is a Public Service

Nowa Lewica promised a free second breakfast for every pupil in the first three
years of primary school. The education ministry can make eating together part
of the school day, or ask municipalities to identify the children who need it.

- @nowa_lewica_breakfast_universal
- @nowa_lewica_breakfast_priority
- @nowa_lewica_breakfast_refuse

@nowa_lewica_breakfast_universal
title: Serve breakfast in every early-primary classroom
subtitle: Cost: 3 budget capacity. Nutrition becomes universal school infrastructure; delivery is expensive and visible.
