= One Student Ticket, Zero Złoty

The programme promises free public transport for every school pupil. Cities can
issue a pass tomorrow; the harder question is whether a free ticket means
anything in a powiat where the last afternoon bus disappeared years ago.

- @nowa_lewica_ticket_national
- @nowa_lewica_ticket_service_first
- @nowa_lewica_ticket_refuse

@nowa_lewica_ticket_national
title: Fund a nationwide pupil pass across local operators
subtitle: Cost: 3 budget capacity. Family costs and car dependence fall; the state must reconcile hundreds of operators.
choose-if: budget >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: Reimbursing operators and integrating the pass need three budget points.
