The treasury pays operators for service delivered, making missing routes as
visible as missing reimbursements.

- #poland_card_finish

@nowa_lewica_ticket_service_first
title: Guarantee the route before making the ticket free
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. Restore rural service first and let cities retain their own discounts.
