travel first in the thinnest networks. Metropolitan pupils keep a patchwork of
local concessions while empty timetables receive buses.

- #poland_card_finish

@nowa_lewica_ticket_refuse
title: Expand local pupil discounts
subtitle: Free. Avoid a national reimbursement system; the value of being a pupil still depends on the postcode.
