= A Nurse and a Psychologist Behind the School Door

Nowa Lewica's priorities strengthen both medical and psychological care in
schools. Ministers agree with the destination and dispute the promise: a named
professional in every building, or a team that covers several schools without
pretending scarce staff can be cloned.

- @nowa_lewica_school_health_standard
- @nowa_lewica_school_health_teams
- @nowa_lewica_school_health_refuse

@nowa_lewica_school_health_standard
title: Guarantee both professions in every school network
subtitle: Cost: 3 budget capacity. Access and prevention improve sharply; recruitment becomes the government's test.
choose-if: budget >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: Salaries, training places and rooms need three budget points.
