= Grief Must Not Cut the Household Income in Half

Rent and heating do not halve when one pensioner dies. The widow's-pension
proposal lets the survivor retain their own benefit and part of their partner's,
turning that arithmetic into one of Nowa Lewica's clearest promises to older voters.

- @nowa_lewica_widow_full
- @nowa_lewica_widow_capped
- @nowa_lewica_widow_refuse

@nowa_lewica_widow_full
title: Pay the full pension plus half of the second
subtitle: Cost: 3 budget capacity. Older households gain real security; the permanent pension bill draws a coalition fight.
choose-if: budget >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: The uncapped combined benefit needs three budget points.
on-arrival: budget -= 3; fiscal_stress += 4; public_debt += 2; pensioner_support += 9; women_support += 5; household_security += 8; workers_support += 2; government_goal_welfare = 1; public_trust += 5; universal_solidarity += 4; government_delivery += 4; ko_relation -= 2; p2050_relation -= 2; government_coalition_dissent += 5; news_headline = "Government enacts a full widow's pension without an income cliff"

The survivor chooses the larger pension and receives half of the smaller. The
right is individual, automatic and expensive enough that no coalition partner
can pretend it was a technical amendment.

- #poland_card_finish

@nowa_lewica_widow_capped
title: Combine benefits under a generous ceiling
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. Protect ordinary pensions first while containing the highest payments.
choose-if: budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The capped combined benefit needs two budget points.
on-arrival: budget -= 2; fiscal_stress += 2; pensioner_support += 7; women_support += 4; household_security += 6; government_goal_welfare = 1; public_trust += 4; universal_solidarity += 2; government_delivery += 3; p2050_relation += 1; government_coalition_dissent += 2; news_headline = "A capped widow's pension protects ordinary retired households"

Most surviving spouses receive the combination in full; high benefits taper at
a published ceiling. The principle survives and the sharpest fiscal objection weakens.

- #poland_card_finish

@nowa_lewica_widow_refuse
title: Raise the existing survivor allowance
subtitle: Free. Deliver a smaller improvement quickly; the household-income cliff remains.
on-arrival: poland_nowa_lewica_widow_pension_timer = 8; pensioner_support += 2; household_security += 2; women_support -= 2; public_trust -= 2; fiscal_stress -= 1; p2050_relation += 2; government_coalition_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "Cabinet raises survivor support but rejects a combined widow's pension"

The allowance grows without changing the rule that one contribution record
disappears from the household. The bill is smaller because the loss remains larger.

- #poland_card_finish


