= Count the Empty Homes

Nowa Lewica's housing strategy asks for a Central Register of Premises and a
municipal tax on homes kept vacant. Owners call the register a presumption of
guilt; mayors answer that they cannot govern a shortage they are forbidden to count.

- @nowa_lewica_empty_homes_register
- @nowa_lewica_empty_homes_public_first
- @nowa_lewica_empty_homes_refuse

@nowa_lewica_empty_homes_register
title: Register vacancies and authorise a municipal surtax
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. Cities gain data and leverage; property owners organise against both.
choose-if: budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Building the register and enforcement system needs two budget points.
on-arrival: budget -= 2; administrative_capacity += 6; local_network += 5; household_security += 7; government_delivery += 4; government_goal_housing = 1; public_trust += 3; universal_solidarity += 3; economic_growth += 0.2; market_liberal_dissent += 7; ko_relation -= 4; p2050_relation -= 3; government_coalition_dissent += 4; news_headline = "Municipalities gain a vacancy register and power to tax empty homes"

Utilities and declarations identify long-term vacancy, with exemptions for
renovation, probate and temporary absence. Revenue must return to social rental
housing, making the tax both pressure and supply.

- #poland_card_finish

@nowa_lewica_empty_homes_public_first
title: Inventory public vacancies and fund voluntary leases
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Start with property the state controls and incentives private owners can accept.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The public inventory and lease-guarantee fund need one budget point.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; administrative_capacity += 4; local_network += 4; household_security += 5; government_delivery += 3; government_goal_housing = 1; public_trust += 4; economic_growth += 0.1; market_liberal_dissent += 1; ko_relation += 1; coalition_blur += 1; news_headline = "Government inventories public vacancies and guarantees social leases"

Public bodies must report unused homes, while private owners receive rent and
repair guarantees for leasing through a municipality. The state counts itself
first and leaves compulsory private disclosure for another bill.

- #poland_card_finish

@nowa_lewica_empty_homes_refuse
title: Offer renovation grants without a register
subtitle: Free. Bring some homes back voluntarily; mayors still cannot see the stock they are trying to mobilise.
on-arrival: poland_nowa_lewica_empty_homes_timer = 7; household_security += 2; economic_growth += 0.2; administrative_capacity -= 1; local_network -= 2; market_liberal_dissent -= 4; ko_relation += 3; p2050_relation += 2; government_coalition_dissent -= 3; news_headline = "Cabinet offers vacancy renovation grants but refuses a central register"

Owners who already want to rent may claim help. Empty homes whose value lies in
remaining empty stay outside both the programme and the count.

- #poland_card_finish


