Sites, grids and skills are planned for the larger fleet, while Parliament
must release the second half after costs and construction performance are visible.

- #poland_card_finish

@razem_reactors_refuse
title: Complete the existing nuclear project before naming a fleet
subtitle: Free. Limit immediate exposure; Razem says one plant is not an energy system.
on-arrival: poland_razem_eight_reactors_timer = 8; razem_dissent += 10; razem_strength -= 2; energy_security += 2; climate_state_capacity += 1; administrative_capacity += 1; fiscal_stress -= 1; market_liberal_dissent -= 2; p2050_relation += 2; government_coalition_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "Cabinet rejects Razem's eight-reactor fleet for a single-project strategy"

The government concentrates capacity on the procurement already moving. Every
later reactor becomes another cabinet's separate argument.

