= One Percent of GDP in Bricks

Razem proposes an annual housing appropriation equal to one percent of GDP.
Municipalities and tenant cooperatives would build homes that remain outside
the sale market permanently. Treasury officials dislike the automatic number;
tenant groups distrust every programme without one.

- @razem_housing_one_percent
- @razem_housing_ramp
- @razem_housing_refuse

